{"4692890": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Fury of the Axe", "steam_appid": 4692890, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Warrior marked by loss.  </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A World consumed by darkness.  </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Fury that cannot be contained.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When <strong>Kaél</strong> returned to his village… nothing remained.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fire consumed the homes. Steel took his people.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And from the ashes… fury was born.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fury of the Axe</strong> is a brutal action RPG where every fight is a test of skill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in intense melee combat, break enemy defenses, and master a visceral combat system where timing, positioning, and precision mean the difference between life and death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are not a hero.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are what remains.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Brutal melee combat focused on skill and timing  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Challenging enemies with unique mechanics  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Dark and atmospheric world  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Impactful combat with shield breaking and stun mechanics  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Progression driven by player mastery  </p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Warrior marked by loss.  </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A World consumed by darkness.  </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Fury that cannot be contained.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When <strong>